\"1099\">With deep experience across local and global markets, we connect you to test engineers who are proficient in current industry standards, tools, and methodologies. This gives you the advantage of tapping into diverse talent pools and keeping pace with evolving technology trends.</p><p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1401\">As a trusted provider of testing-focused staffing solutions, we customize every engagement to match your project goals and skill requirements. Our global network enables fast onboarding, ensuring you have the specialists needed to keep operations moving efficiently and maintain high product quality.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"cf8e41b","elType":"widget","settings":{"ekit_button_middle_text":"Or","ekit_dual_button_width":{"unit":"%","size":78,"sizes":[]},"ekit_button_one_text":"About Us","ekit_button_two_text":"Contact us","ekit_double_button_one_background_background":"classic","ekit_double_button_one_background_color":"#3D8E4F","__globals__":{"ekit_double_button_one_background_color":""},"ekit_button_one_link":{"url":"https://testoryxetech.com/about-us/","is_external":false,"nofollow":false,"custom_attributes":""},"ekit_button_two_link":{"url":"https://testoryxetech.com/contact-us/","is_external":false,"nofollow":false,"custom_attributes":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"elementskit-dual-button"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"fa15e67","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"50"},"hover_parallax":[{"layer_position_vr":{"unit":"%","size":30},"layer_position_hr":{"unit":"%","size":40},"_id":"14245fd"},{"layer_position_vr":{"unit":"%","size":60},"layer_position_hr":{"unit":"%","size":20},"_id":"ec2fca1"}]},"elements":[{"id":"38a8151","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://testoryxetech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Generated-Image-November-22-2025-2_29PM-1.png","id":743,"size":"","source":"library","alt":""},"image_border_radius":{"unit":